    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《喜剧之王单口季第三季》第七期来啦！</span></p><p><span>新一轮比赛收尾，新的一轮比赛即将开始</span></p><p><span>不知道赛制又要变成什么样子，哈哈哈</span></p><p><span>这一场的门腔，忽然小爆发，小编评价是门腔有史以来最好的一次线上表演</span></p><p><span>包括南瓜，这一次也是王者归来的同时，再次进化</span></p><p><span>嘻哈不遑多让，继续在侠女的赛道上疾驰</span></p><p><span>纪鹏作为中医，对脱发也是下了定论了，治不了</span></p><p><span>贤鱼这次表现超强！虽然出场顺序不是很有优势，但是一个大炸场，直接封神</span></p><p><span>鑫博也非常厉害，本来接贤鱼这样炸的非常难，但鑫博还是接住了，作为一个老司机</span></p><p><span>期待接下来的赛制！还有复活金牌到底谁会用，还能不能用得上~</span></p><p><span>期待！！！</span></p><p><span>本期节目主播：CZ\小鸷\大林</span></p><p><span>欢迎加微信“大密官微”（微信号：dsmmwx0713）进听友群～</span></p><p><span>小红书账号：大声密谋播客（ID：49590324496）</span></p><p><span>本期时点：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a>：开场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a>：赛前闲聊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>：小海</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a>：安全出口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="696">11:36</a>：徐指导</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a>：阳崽儿</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1193">19:53</a>：门腔</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a>：谢谢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a>：七友</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a>：南瓜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a>：多多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a>：嘻哈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a>：大老王</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a>：纪鹏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a>：贤鱼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4016">01:06:56</a>：鑫博</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4422">01:13:42</a>：赛后闲聊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4525">01:15:25<